@defun rptui_init (void) @arrow{} void
Sets the elapsed ``waiting for the user'' time to zero.  Each
@code{rptui_} wrapper then increments this by the amount of time, in
seconds, spent waiting for the user.  This function is typically
called shortly before the script begins exeuction.
@end defun

