@defun value_to_xref (CString val) @arrow{} CString
In DeadEnds, unlike LifeLines, keys contain the `@@'s.
So, after verifying that it is a proper LL/DE key
@*
'@@' <one of the five letters I,F,S,E,X> <numbers> '@@'
@*
rather than strip the3 '@@'s, and return the result, we just return it.
If it is not a proper key, then we return @code{NULL}.
@end defun
